3. GRANT OF RIGHTS

3.1 Subject to the conditions in this licence, the University of Stirling
grants you a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free licence to view,
download, clone, modify, compile, and use the Software for Research
Purposes only.

3.2 This licence permits you to:

    (a) study and understand the Software;

    (b) modify the Software to add new ecological models, decision
    scenarios, or research capabilities;

    (c) compile and run the Software to build Generated Works for
    Research Purposes;

    (d) share the Software and Generated Works with other researchers,
