4. NON-COMMERCIAL RESTRICTION

4.1 The Software and any Generated Work may not be used for Commercial
Use. This includes, but is not limited to:

    (a) product development or commercial deployment;

    (b) retail sale, licensing, or rental;

    (c) corporate grant applications or contracts where the primary
    beneficiary is a commercial entity; and

    (d) any activity from which financial profit or commercial advantage
    is derived.

4.2 For the avoidance of doubt, use of the Software or Generated Works
by government departments, arms-length bodies, or non-governmental
organisations for policy development, environmental assessment, or public
service delivery is permitted provided it is for Research Purposes and
not for Commercial Use.


5. COPYLEFT ON PUBLIC DISTRIBUTION

5.1 If you Publicly Distribute a Generated Work, you must:

    (a) make the complete source code of that Generated Work freely
